              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "o albergue — \"the hostel\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ficámos num albergue para jovens. We stayed in a hostel for young people."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pilgrims on the long walks to the north sleep in albergues."
